Subject: [PATCH v1 0/2] regulator: add Samsung S2MPB03 camera PMIC
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add a binding and driver for the Samsung S2MPB03, a small I2C PMIC that
supplies the rear camera rails (four LDOs + one buck) on the Samsung
Galaxy A52 4G (a52q, SM7125).

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

Miroslav Mráz (2):
